.TH tunotes n 0.30.0 tclutils "Tcl Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tclutils::tunotes \- hierarchical note store
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tclutils::tunotes
.SH DESCRIPTION
A dependency-light store for a tree of notes (id, parent_id, title, content,
created, modified, tags). Mutators take a store variable name; queries take the
store value. Persistence uses tclutils::tujson. See docs/tunotes.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n), tujson
.SH KEYWORDS
notes, tree, hierarchy, json
